          }
        },
        "block_1_6mzkw6": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Recycling Instructions",
            "content": "",
            "html": "<script src=\"https://app.bluebirdclimate.com/embed/summer-fridays?id=A52_QqNR_2XtHyd2VNIg-M9ek1Vl4TIrZV3crUMzmAqH_3h0gStWQjarDs4vSRPFyoFyWZUbeoq2VqHEOR_u1kY72mdyy5zHwNT0IzYtU6b9PY8fvuGNPQ\" async=\"\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>"
          }
        },
        "block_1_6X4eXk": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sustainability",
            "content": "<p>Learn more about sustainability <a href=\"/pages/sustainability\" title=\"Sustainability\">here</a>.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Babymoon Belly Balm vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Babymoon Belly Balm gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Babymoon Belly Balm is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. <br/><br/>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Babymoon Belly Balm suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Babymoon Belly Balm is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does this product smell like?",
            "content": "<p>Babymoon Belly Balm has a very subtle, soothing scent that is 100% natural, which many women find easier to tolerate during pregnancy than traditional synthetic fragrances. The product's calming, citrus-y herbal scent is a blend of pure essential oils—including calendula, rose, lavender and orange—that's reminiscent of running through a field of flowers.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dnfwT7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does this product protect my skin from stretch marks?",
            "content": "<p>Skin's first line of defense against stretch marks is moisture. When your skin is well hydrated, it's also more supple—and that elasticity is the key to reducing the chance of stretch marks.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_Yakhx4": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I pair this with other body moisturizers? Is this in replacement of my moisturizer?",
            "content": "<p>Babymoon Belly Balm is so intensely hydrating, you might find it's the only body moisturizer you need. But if you're already using a body lotion you love, Babymoon Belly Balm is the perfect final layer to help seal in benefits. Just wait a few minutes between applying each product to allow for complete absorption.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
